  "releaseNotes": "## v2.6.11 (patch)\n\nChanges since v2.6.10:\n\n- Split fixed-point formatting helpers and use Assert.Contains [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Support the F, N, E, R and G<n> standard format strings [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Throw OverflowException when Add/Subtract/Mod exponents are too far apart to align [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
